ObserverTest
├── startObserver
│   ├── given a document with a body
│   │   ├── it watches the body
│   │   └── it watches shadow roots separately
│   ├── given no body
│   │   └── it does not start
│   └── given it is already running
│       └── it keeps the same observer and takes the new config
├── isOwnWrite
│   ├── given an element inside our span
│   │   └── it is ours
│   ├── given a text node inside our span
│   │   └── it is ours
│   ├── given an element the page owns
│   │   └── it is not ours
│   └── given a node with no parent element
│       └── it is not ours
├── isStillInPage
│   ├── given a node in the document
│   │   └── it is in the page
│   ├── given a node removed from the document
│   │   └── it is not in the page
│   ├── given a node inside a live shadow tree
│   │   └── it is in the page
│   ├── given a node inside a detached shadow tree
│   │   └── it is not in the page
│   └── given a node in a fragment
│       └── it is not in the page
├── reacting to mutations
│   ├── given an element is added
│   │   ├── it converts prices inside it
│   │   └── it walks that element and nothing wider
│   ├── given the added element is our own output
│   │   └── it is ignored
│   ├── given a converted element is put back into the page
│   │   └── it is not walked again
│   ├── given text is added inside a converted element
│   │   ├── it reverts the stale conversion
│   │   └── it converts the new text
│   ├── given text is added outside any conversion
│   │   └── it converts the parent
│   ├── given text is added inside our own span
│   │   └── it is ignored
│   ├── given text is added and taken away in the same batch
│   │   └── it converts the rest of the batch
│   ├── given text changes in a converted element
│   │   ├── it reverts the stale conversion
│   │   └── it converts the new text
│   ├── given text changes beside a converted price
│   │   └── it reverts and re-converts the whole element
│   ├── given a second price appears beside a converted one
│   │   ├── it clears the stale conversion
│   │   └── it converts both prices
│   ├── given the page took our span but left the element marked
│   │   └── it converts the price the page wrote
│   ├── given text changes outside any conversion
│   │   └── it converts the element
│   ├── given text changes inside our own span
│   │   ├── it is ignored
│   │   └── it does not ask for a frame
│   ├── given text changes on a node the page then detaches
│   │   └── it converts the rest of the batch
│   ├── given the converter drains the queue in the same task
│   │   └── it still converts what the page changed
│   └── given a shadow root appears with new content
│       ├── it is observed too
│       └── given the same root is probed again
│           └── it is not observed twice
├── given the observer was never started
│   └── it does nothing
├── batching
│   ├── given several roots in one batch
│   │   └── it converts once per frame
│   ├── given a second batch arrives before the frame runs
│   │   ├── it reuses the frame it already asked for
│   │   └── it reuses the timer it already set
│   ├── given one queued root contains another
│   │   ├── it skips the one already covered
│   │   └── it walks the outer root only
│   ├── given a second batch after the first flush
│   │   └── it walks only what changed
│   ├── given a root left the page before the flush
│   │   └── it is not converted
│   ├── given a root inside a shadow tree
│   │   └── it is still considered part of the page
│   ├── given the document is never rendered
│   │   └── it flushes on a timer instead
│   ├── given an infinite-scroll page queues past the cap
│   │   ├── it falls back to rescanning the body once
│   │   └── it still converts everything that was queued
│   └── given the page has no body when the queue overflows
│       └── it drops the batch
├── flushing the queue
│   ├── given the frame runs first
│   │   ├── it drops the timer it no longer needs
│   │   ├── it can set a timer again
│   │   └── it does not cancel a frame that already ran
│   └── given the timer runs first
│       ├── it drops the frame it no longer needs
│       ├── it can ask for a frame again
│       └── it does not clear a timer that already fired
├── SPA route changes
│   ├── given the page pushes a new route
│   │   ├── it clears what the last route left behind
│   │   └── it converts what the new route brought in
│   ├── given the page replaces the route
│   │   └── it does the same
│   ├── given the user goes back
│   │   └── it does the same
│   └── given a component upgraded since the last pass
│       └── it watches the new shadow tree
├── after stopping
│   ├── given records are replayed anyway
│   │   └── it does nothing
│   ├── given a route change fires anyway
│   │   └── it does nothing
│   └── given a route change was already queued
│       └── it does nothing
├── stopObserver
│   ├── it disconnects the observer
│   ├── it restores the history methods it patched
│   ├── it stops listening for the back button
│   ├── it unregisters itself from the converter
│   ├── it cancels the frame it had queued
│   ├── given nothing was queued
│   │   └── it cancels nothing
│   ├── it drops any queued work
│   └── it does not carry queued work into the next session
└── updateObserverConfig
    ├── given the observer is running
    │   ├── it swaps the rates without tearing the observer down
    │   ├── it converts at the new rate
    │   └── it keeps the held rate
    └── given the observer is not running
        └── it starts one
